        "sid": "DEU 1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tunini dubbi Musani worra Israeli ch'ufa gaafa worri lafa aloo, ta galaana Yordanitini ilaboru jiru jed'eeni. Worri gaafasi bale Yordani keesa d'aatu sufu, ta dira Paranitifi, Tofelitifi, Labanitifi, Hazerothitifi, Dizahabu jiddu jirtu jira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Godaanti gaara Sinaitifi ta Kadesh-Barnea jiddu guyya kud'ani toko fud'atti, yo kara gaareeni ka lafa Edomutiini godaanani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammalle ganna afurtameeso guyya qara ka jia kud'ani tokeeso keesa, Musani eegi lafa Misiri keesa bahani waan AABBO Waaqi biyyati himi jed'eeni kaani ch'ufa worra Israeliti haasae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.2.21+NUM.2.22+NUM.2.23+NUM.2.24+NUM.2.25+NUM.2.26+NUM.2.27+NUM.2.28+NUM.2.29+NUM.2.30+NUM.2.31+NUM.2.32+NUM.2.33+NUM.2.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hen 2.21-34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tunini eegi AABBO Waaqi hayyu Sioni, ka gosa Amori, ka dira Heshbonitifi ammalle hayyu Ogu ka lafa Bashani, ka dira Ashtarothitifi Edrei dabsate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaafi Musani dubbi seera Waaqatifi barsiisa isaa biyyati hime gaafa biyyiti Yordanini ilaboru, lafa Moabu keesa, jirtu. Inni waan jed'e, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaafa nu gaara Sinai jiru AABBO Waaqi keenna waan nuuni jed'e, Isani ya fulla gaara kana guddo teetani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tanaafi amma faad'a durati godaana lafa gaareeni ta Amoritifi lafa d'aatu d'ibii: bale Yordani faa, lafa gaareeni ammalle lafa golbo, ta bitaa faa, ammalle lafa afaani baariini lafa Kanaanitiifi lafa gaara Lebanoni. Haga galaana gudda Efrati d'aqa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lafti tunini ch'ufti lafa anini AABBO Waaqi ababoota teesani Abrahamufi Isaaqofi Yakobofi ilmaani worrale ch'ufa inkenna jed'e kakhad'e; d'aqaa iti qubad'a.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aka Musani jaallaboota gumi tolche",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musani waan gumi Israelitini jed'e, Gaafa nu gaara Sinai jiru, Anini waan isaniini jed'e, Hujiini nama dura deemani tunini ya nati guddatte, anini dandae ufiti intolchu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqi keesani yayu isaani daraarse, aka urji gubaa isani heddeese. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqi, Waaqi ababoota teesani, hagasile ira maro kuma isani daraarse isani deebansinna, akuma inni intolcha jed'e kakhate! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammo anini ch'allaani akami dandae huji jabdu dubbi qorani tana ufumati tolcha? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gosa ch'ufa keesa nama qaro, ka hubachafi beekha qabu filad'a, duuba anini jara suni gudda keesani tolcha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isanileeni aka wonti kunini waan dansa, ka tolchuu malani ya ee jettani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba anini worra qaro, beekhafi hubacha qabu, ka isani gosa teesani keesa filatani, mataa isani tolche worri hagi toko mataa nama kuma tahe hagiini ka nama shantama tahe, hagi tokoleeni ka nama kud'ani tahe. Ammalle anini nama gugurda d'ibi gosa keesaa fohad'e.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaafasi anini iti hime waan jed'eeni, Dubbi wold'abisa ta nama keesani iraa d'uftu laala. Dubbi wold'abaa tana ch'ufa aka dansaa qoraa, ato isiini nama keesanifi keessuma isani keesa teetu iraa d'uftele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nama tokole ira inch'iisina dubbi murtani keesa ato inni nama fed'e taatele, waan inni tahe gula wollaala iti mura. Nama tokole insodaatini, wonti akanatiifi wonti isani murtani Waaqa iraa d'ufti. Yo dubbini isani d'ibde natiini koota, nati mura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammalle artumati hojuma suni waan isani tolchuu maltanile isaniti hima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aka nama dooya lafa Kadesh-Barnea keesaa ergani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nu waan AABBO Waaqi keenna tolcha nuuni jed'e, tolchine. Duuba gaafa gaareeni Amoriti godaane, gaara Sinaiti kaane lafa aloo ballo nama sodaachiftu keesa dabarre. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini waan jed'e isani amma yayu lafa gaareeni ta Amoritini baatani ta AABBO Waaqi keenna Waaqi ababoota teenna, nu kennuti jiru kuno suni, ilaala. Beena, aka inni jed'e iti qubad'a. Irinch'ich'ina yokhaani insodaatina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.20+DEU.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.20",
              "DEU.1.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.20+DEU.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.20",
              "DEU.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammo isani nati d'uftani waan jettani, Nama ufi dura ergina ka lafa suni dooyatu, aka worri kara dansa nu gula godaanuufi dira dadansa achi jiru nuti himu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wonti kunini dansa arge jennaani nama kud'ani lama gosa ch'ufa keesaa toko toko, fohad'e. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri lafa gaareeniti iti d'aabate, haga bale Eshkoli ch'ufa dooyatani laalatani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri mid'aani achi argateeni nuu gale waan jed'e, Lafti AABBO Waaqi nuu kennu lafa gabbo waan ch'ufa qabdu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
