              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ebr 3.16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammo isani dubbi AABBO Waaqa keesani diddani, tanaafi lafa suni inseeniini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isani gungumtani waan jettani AABBO Waaqi nu jibba, tanaafi inni lafa Misiri keesaa nuu baase harka worra Amoriti nu kenne aka worri nu hobaasu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nu achi iyyaanu, insodaanna worri nu ergine waan nuni jed'e, worri lafa suni worra jajaba d'ed'eera, haga arba gagahu, ka dira worrale naabo isaa d'akhaani marsani waaqati d'aabani jaarani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
