            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqi dubbi teesani d'agaye dallane, kakhate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waan jed'e, Isaniini tokoleeni, nami d'aloota ch'ubbu kana keesa jiru lafa gabbo dansa anini abbooti teesani kakhad'e inargattani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kalebu ilma Yefune male, isa ch'allati naa saalfate nama d'uga naa tahe, tanaafi anini isaafi ilmaani isaati lafa worri dooyate taani kennaafi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maro teesanifi AABBO Waaqi nati dallane, atinileeni, Musa lafa suni inseentu naani jed'e. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammo Yoshuani, ilmi Nuni ka amma isani dura deemu, lafa suni inseena. Isa garaa jabeesa; wonti akanatiifi isumati Israeli lafa suni d'aalchisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
