          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammo Waaqi waan naani jed'e, Waan atini worraani jettu, nyaapa keesani inhad'ina, anini isani inqarqaaru, tanaafi nyaapi worraa worra dabsata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini waan AABBO Waaqi jed'e isaniti hime, ammo isani inch'aqamne. Isani isa jalaa diddani, mata guddifattani, lafa gaareeniti iti d'aabatani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani worri Amori, ka lafa gaaraa suni keesa tau, aka tuuta kinniisa isaniti baafate, haga lafa Horma isani reebe, ammalle lafa gaareeni taa Edomuti isani dabsate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba isani qarqaarsa AABBO Waaqati bootani, ammo inni isani ind'ageenne yokhaani inch'aqamne.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
